      { t:"19:30", title:"Dinner: Ziggy's or Dibek", place:"ziggys", places:["dibek"], cost:"≈ 1,100 ₺", html:"<b>Ziggy's</b> (Ürgüp, 10 min, a set of 20 mezes, terrace, reserve) or <b>Dibek</b> (Göreme, testi kebab cooked 3 hours in a clay pot and cracked open at the table, book 2 hours ahead). Return taxi, 2 cars 700 ₺." }
